# Graphify (when available)

Only when `graphify-out/graph.json` exists, or the user asks to build/query a graph:

1. Prefer `graphify query "<q>"`, `graphify path "A" "B"`, `graphify explain "X"` over repo-wide Grep.
2. Use `graphify-out/wiki/index.md` if present for navigation.
3. After substantial code edits: `graphify update .` (AST-only, no LLM cost).
4. First build: `/graphify .` or ask before a full build if the corpus is large.

Do not force graphify before every Read when no graph exists yet.
